    {
      "number": 65,
      "category": "",
      "title": "三國志卷六十五·王蕃及二弟",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-065-wangfan-complete:p001",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "江人也。博覽多聞，兼通術藝。始為尚書郎，去官。孫休即位，與賀邵、薛瑩、虞汜俱為散騎中常侍，皆加駙馬都尉。時論清之。遣使至蜀，蜀人稱焉，還為夏口監軍。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-065-wangfan-complete:p001"
      ],
      "mention_ids": [
